Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:01.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Okay, let me talk about Balenciaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:01.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}よし、Balenciagaの話をさせてくれ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:03.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Since you did the last interview,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:03.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}I've been Balenciaga,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:03.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}前回のインタビュー以来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:03.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺はずっとBalenciagaなんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:06.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}y'all. You know my nickname is Yalla.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:06.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}俺のあだ名はYallaだろ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.51,0:00:08.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So now they call me Balenci-Yalla.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.51,0:00:08.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}だから今じゃ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.51,0:00:08.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Balenci-Yallaって呼ばれてる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.47,0:00:12.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Balenciaga has the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.47,0:00:12.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}best design because
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.47,0:00:12.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Balenciagaのデザインが最高なのは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.18,0:00:15.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}they have the best designer, period.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.18,0:00:15.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}最高のデザイナーがいるからだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.18,0:00:15.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}それだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:17.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And that's not you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:17.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}それはあんたじゃないの？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.35,0:00:20.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I'm more like a Steve Jobs type.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.35,0:00:20.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}俺はどっちかっていうと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.35,0:00:20.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}スティーブ・ジョブズタイプ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:23.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You know, you say to Steve,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:23.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}like, yo, you don't even program.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:23.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}スティーブに「お前プログラム
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:23.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}書かないじゃん」って言うようなもんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:26.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You know, I would never
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:26.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}disrespect a designer that been to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:26.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}学校に通って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:26.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}型紙も切れて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.99,0:00:30.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}school and that can cut and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.99,0:00:30.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}have dedicated their whole life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.99,0:00:30.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}人生を捧げてきたデザイナーを差し置いて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.99,0:00:30.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}自分をデザイナーだなんて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.71,0:00:32.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and call myself a designer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.71,0:00:32.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}絶対に名乗らない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:34.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I'm more an imagineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:34.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}俺はむしろ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:34.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}「イマジニア」なんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.91,0:00:39.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I'm a visionary, and I place the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.91,0:00:39.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}pieces of our culture together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.91,0:00:39.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ビジョンを描いて　俺たちのカルチャーの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.91,0:00:39.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ピースを組み合わせる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.59,0:00:44.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Even right now, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.59,0:00:44.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}I want to bring joy and laughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.59,0:00:44.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}今だってさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.59,0:00:44.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}喜びと笑いを届けたいんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.03,0:00:46.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So even if, say, say,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.03,0:00:46.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}say, we wanted to, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.43,0:00:49.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}look at the interview and we have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.43,0:00:49.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}a conversation after and say,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.43,0:00:49.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}たとえばこのインタビューを見返して
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.43,0:00:49.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}話し合ったとしても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:50.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}look, do we need this first segment?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:50.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}「最初のパートって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:50.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}要る？」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.79,0:00:53.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Let's just do the s**t that's like,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.79,0:00:53.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}you know, it's controversial,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.79,0:00:53.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}物議を醸すやつは　そのままでいい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.79,0:00:53.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}だってみんな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.69,0:00:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}because people ain't going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.69,0:00:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}to really name names.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.69,0:00:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}はっきり名前は出さないから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.49,0:00:58.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But it's funny still. I think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.49,0:00:58.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}でもやっぱり笑えるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.49,0:00:58.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}そう思う
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.37,0:01:01.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}It's like, we need joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.37,0:01:01.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}It's too much pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.37,0:01:01.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺たちには喜びが必要だ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.37,0:01:01.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}痛みが多すぎる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.61,0:01:03.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You know, it's too much anger,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.61,0:01:03.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}怒りも多すぎるし
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:05.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and it's too much trauma economy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:05.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}「トラウマ経済」が
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:05.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}デカすぎる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.35,0:00:22.21,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1170)\fs40}スティーブ・ジョブズ：Appleの共同創業者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:39.81,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1170)\fs40}イマジニア：imagine（想像）とengineer（技術者）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:39.81,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1218)\fs40}を合わせた造語。Disneyの用語
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.61,0:01:05.48,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1120)\fs40}トラウマ経済：人々の苦しみを消費して利益を生む
